; vecset_index_out_of_range: VECSET with an index one past the end raises IndexOutOfBounds.
;
; spec/xqvm/ISA.md's VECSET row bounds-checks 0 <= idx < len, and
; spec/xqvm/SPEC.md's Faults table raises IndexOutOfBounds for an index
; outside the vec it addresses.

VECI r0
PUSH 7
VECPUSH r0       ; r0 = [7], length 1
PUSH 1          ; index, one past the end
PUSH 9           ; value
VECSET r0
HALT
